 # ---- Search R6/R7/R10–R12 (SEARCH_DISCOVERY_CLOSURE.md); R1–R5 and R8–R9 are PB-0490/PB-0491 ----
 C("PB-0492", "SEARCH-R", "P5", "04_NAV_UX (new block SEARCH-ALIAS-001…012)", "governed bilingual discovery aliases", "alias_en / alias_ar / target / boundary_note",
   "(absent) — 'law' returns 0 results in English; «لائحة» returns 0 in Arabic; 'decision' / «قرار» reach a decision record only at rank 7 (/evidence/PSE-011/) and no decision source at all (probe in SEARCH_DISCOVERY_CLOSURE.md §2).",
   "12 governed alias rows (discovery only; an alias never asserts that two things mean the same): law/laws/قانون/قوانين → document_type 'law'; decision/decisions/قرار/قرارات → 'decision/enforcement'; circular/تعميم/تعاميم → 'instruction/circular'; regulation/regulations/instructions/لائحة/لوائح/تعليمات → 'regulation' and 'instruction/circular' (document_type is created by PB-0493); remittance/remittances/حوالة/حوالات/تحويلات → /remittances/; exchange company/صرافة/شركات الصرافة/منشآت الصرافة → /providers/; wallet/e-wallet/محفظة/محافظ → /payments/; POS/point of sale/نقاط البيع/نقطة بيع → /payments/; microfinance/MFB/MFI/التمويل الأصغر/تمويل أصغر → /finance/; exchange rate/سعر الصرف/أسعار الصرف → /finance/; measurement agenda/أجندة القياس/القياس → /measurement/; financial literacy/financial education/الثقافة المالية/التثقيف المالي → /people/ + /reforms/ with boundary_note 'financial-education activity is not literacy, capability or behaviour' shown on the result. Rejected: an issuer-only alias (e.g. 'CBY' → every CBY document).",
   "both", "CROSS_LINK_CHANGE", "Search probe this window (28 terms × 2 languages, validator's own scoring).", "Legal and regulatory instruments and core domain terms are not findable by the words users type.",
   "search_index.json; search UI", "Every alias query returns its target in the top 3 in both languages; the literacy alias result shows its boundary note.", op="NEW"),
 C("PB-0493", "SEARCH-R", "P5", "GENERATOR: search_index.json + search scoring", "ranking and result card", "page-class weight; facets; result badges",
   "Domain pages rank below their own evidence records for the domain's core term (e.g. 'POS terminals' and «نقاط البيع» → /payments/ absent from the top 10; «الحوالات» → /remittances/ absent from the top 10). 15_SOURCE_LIBRARY has no document_type or evidence_role column. Result cards carry no document type, evidence state or date.",
   "(a) A domain page whose title or primary question contains the query term ranks first for that term; (b) acceptance correction E — keep document type and evidence role separate, and do not force one role per source: add document_type (one controlled value per source: law · regulation · decision/enforcement · instruction/circular · survey · dataset · official statistic · report/research · method/standard · provider-status instrument · consumer-protection material · financial-capability material) and evidence_roles (the controlled roles the source performs across its uses, one or more of: primary factual evidence · status event · Yemen analytical literature · global method reference · context) to 15_SOURCE_LIBRARY, and record the role of each source in a particular use on the source→record relationship (06 source_use_roles, alongside the PB-0010…PB-0069 bindings); populate only where the Master already states the document kind or the use (e.g. 22 status events name each decision instrument), leave the rest unassigned rather than inferring from a URL or ID family, and expose document type and role as separate search facets; no numerical source-quality score; (c) every result card shows evidence state and observation/publication date so historical records are not read as current.",
   "both", "CROSS_LINK_CHANGE", "As PB-0492; Resource Library facet spec (RESOURCE_LIBRARY_CLOSURE.md, Tranche A).", "Discovery must reach the answer page first and must not strip currentness.",
   "search UI; search_index.json", "Probe: all 28 terms reach the expected route in the top 3 (EN and AR); result cards show state and date.", sem="no", op="GENERATOR_RULE"),
 C("PB-0494", "SEARCH-R", "P5", "navigation_interaction.json (projection of 04_NAV_UX)", "search_smoke_tests", "tests",
   "9 bilingual tests; validator accepts a test if ANY expected route is in the top 10 (so 'POS terminals' and 'Fast Payment System' pass while one expected route is missing).",
   "Keep the 9; add 12 from the probe's FAIL/WEAK terms (law/قانون, regulation/لائحة, decision/قرار, remittances/الحوالات, POS/نقاط البيع, income/الدخل, financial literacy/الثقافة المالية, microfinance/التمويل الأصغر, exchange rate/سعر الصرف, measurement agenda/أجندة القياس, e-wallet/المحافظ الإلكترونية, credit/الائتمان) with expected routes as in SEARCH_DISCOVERY_CLOSURE.md §2; primary expected route must be in the top 3.",
   "both", "CROSS_LINK_CHANGE", "validate.py lines 1284–1326 (scoring and ANY-rule).", "Tests must fail when the answer page is not found.",
   "validate.py; navigation_interaction.json", "21 smoke tests pass under the top-3 primary-route rule in both languages.", sem="no", op="SCHEMA"),

